#: ../../openmvcam/shields/motor-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/motor-shield.rst:6
msgid "Motor Shield"
msgstr "Motor Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/motor-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Motor Shield drives two DC motors from the OpenMV Cam using a TB6612FNG "
"dual H-bridge, with an NCP1117 5 V linear regulator that powers both the "
"camera and the motors from a single 6.5–18 V battery input."
msgstr ""
"Motor Shield, bir TB6612FNG çift H-köprüsü kullanarak OpenMV Cam'den iki DC "
"motor sürer ve hem kamerayı hem de motorları tek bir 6.5–18 V pil girişinden"
" besleyen bir NCP1117 5 V doğrusal regülatör içerir."

